4. WHAT THE FIX ROUND INTRODUCED — everything I looked at
=============================================================================

Diff reviewed line by line: `git diff 608b05b HEAD` is 6 source files
(apps/server/test/board.test.ts, apps/web/src/components/w025.css,
apps/web/src/screens/Board.tsx, apps/web/src/screens/BoardDrawer.tsx,
